==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Hariyama|68}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion; both cards have the Push Out attack.
*'''Push Out''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Hariyama|20}} from the {{TCG|Arceus}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

